      "en": "Behold, children are a heritage of the LORD. The fruit of the womb is his reward.",
      "ko": "자식은 여호와의 주신 기업이요 태의 열매는 그의 상급이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "0c8d29c681a5284d788121d53a6069f76bdaece97eebf2bca1ce6bf35141ab94",
      "translation_text_hash": "03b80feec8dae96fa2863db66e8d8511f2fc92ac17d50ad3bea50c9e173c0a88",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
