      ],
      "en": "Happy is the man who has his quiver full of them. They won’t be disappointed when they speak with their enemies in the gate.",
      "ko": "이것이 그 전통에 가득한 자는 복되도다 저희가 성문에서 그 원수와 말할 때에 수치를 당치 아니하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "9b9d77fc51e930fc9b38f85c2473879d8689c82ea2e1e1ce8f50b924388bce0f",
      "translation_text_hash": "76c5cfc84b8ad124983e1a46896b91fa537d4c432a35432dbc722692266960a3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
